      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8302,
      "back_translation": "塑料在日常生活中很常见，但很多塑料不容易分解，会影响环境。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8421,
      "back_translation": "为了解决这个问题，科学家们开始研究一种叫做可降解塑料的新材料。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8923,
      "back_translation": "这种塑料和普通塑料不同，它可以在自然界中慢慢变小，最后变成水和二氧化碳。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 3,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9231,
      "back_translation": "它的主要成分是一种叫做聚合物的物质，这种物质的结构让微生物可以“吃”掉它。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 4,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.898,
      "back_translation": "微生物是小到眼睛看不见的生物，它们生活在土壤和水里。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 5,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8955,
      "back_translation": "当可降解塑料被扔进土壤里，微生物就会靠近它，把它当作食物，一点一点地把它分解。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 6,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.875,
      "back_translation": "这个过程需要时间和合适的条件，比如足够的水分和温暖。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 7,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.963,
      "back_translation": "如果太冷或者太干，分解就会变慢。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 8,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 1.0,
      "back_translation": "研究发现，不同种类的可降解塑料被微生物分解的速度也不一样。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 9,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8,
      "back_translation": "有的几个月就能完全分解，有的则需要几年。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 10,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 1.0,
      "back_translation": "材料科学的发展帮助人类设计出更环保的塑料。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 11,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.8679,
      "back_translation": "现在，科学家们仍在继续研究怎样让这种塑料既结实又容易分解。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 12,
      "verdict": "pass",
      "entailment_ok": true,
      "changed": false,
      "notes": "",
      "tightness": 0.9286,
      "back_translation": "虽然可降解塑料比普通塑料贵一点，但它对陆地和海洋的伤害更小。"
    },
    {
      "idx": 13,
      "verdict": "pass",
